job description:
Introduction & SummaryWe are seeking a Consultant who will play a pivotal role within the IT team dedicated to performance computation and reporting. Key skills demanded for this role include a strong foundation in .NET Core Framework and C#, alongside robust experience in data workflow development and integrations.Main ResponsibilitiesDeveloping target data workflows based on project specifications.Implementing solutions using SSIS and/or API technologies.Contributing to data integration and performance reporting solutions.Ensuring quality, stability, and scalability of developed flows.Key RequirementsStrong knowledge of .NET Core Framework and C#.REST API development experience.Very good knowledge of SSIS and SSAS.Good knowledge of SQL Server.Understanding of design patterns and clean code principles.Practical experience working in Agile methodologies.Knowledge of Git and Azure DevOps.Data management and modularization experience.Understanding of Data Warehouse concepts.Knowledge of Power BI.Asset Management domain knowledge is a plus.Ability to work autonomously as well as collaboratively.Other DetailsThe mission duration is anticipated to last between 6 and 9 months, commencing on June 1, 2026. This position is onsite in Belgium;




